#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:45
#: 33b4706543d944e6b25c79a969552cfd
msgid "Connect the camera to the Ubuntu workstation, start and adb shell and `run voxl-configure-vision-px4 <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-vision-px4-installation/>`__ (Note: you may simply press <enter> when asked for an IP address)"
